WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.610
An assembly, a parlour, a drawing room.

2
00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.360
One young woman makes up her
mind about everyone she meets.

3
00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.410
Proud.

4
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:09.580
Charming.

5
00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:10.960
Ridiculous.

6
00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:11.950
Sensible.

7
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.410
Stamp, stamp, stamp, stamp.

8
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:18.830
Her father says "Lizzy has something
more of quickness than her sisters".

9
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.220
She's quick, and she's sure.

10
00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:24.030
Then a sealed letter drops into the scene,

11
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.090
and the cards begin to tremble.

12
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.400
She's sure of every verdict.

13
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.030
Should we be sure too?

14
00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:35.450
In this mission, you'll meet a witty,
independent heroine who turns down two proposals.

15
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.070
And you'll follow how fast
she judges Darcy and Wickham,

16
00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.620
right up to the moment
that letter arrives.

17
00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:45.250
Your mission: decide whether
we should trust her judgement.
